like Serdeo Selbert.

294
00:20:38,300 --> 00:20:40,360
Was that out of sympathy for me?

295
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:41,757
No, not at all!

296
00:20:41,840 --> 00:20:43,840
I would never be so disrespectful!

297
00:20:44,320 --> 00:20:49,261
I chose you because I was so in awe of your
sword technique and skills as a warrior.

298
00:20:50,100 --> 00:20:55,240
And it is due to your unwavering support
that I was able to survive to see this day.

299
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:57,060
I thank you.

300
00:21:00,660 --> 00:21:03,620
Lady Alice, you speak with such finality.

301
00:21:03,860 --> 00:21:08,260
It is as if you think your journey,
instead of going on, is about to end.

302
00:21:09,080 --> 00:21:10,020
